OL,3,GNEWSATeen admits stabbing man in golf
OL,4,Acourse attack
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 17-year-old boy has pleaded guilty to
OL,7,Fattempted murder after he stabbed a man
OL,8,Fseveral times at a golf course in
OL,9,FStaffordshire.
OL,11,FThe teenager, who cannot be named for
OL,12,Flegal reasons, attacked the victim on a
OL,13,Fpublic footpath through the Stafford
OL,14,FCastle venue on 14 May.
OL,16,FThe man, in his 60s, suffered critical
OL,17,Finjuries and had a series of operations
OL,18,Fin hospital before he was discharged,
OL,19,FStaffordshire Police said.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
